              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मोड़ (moṛ) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from muṭati, \"twists\" (CDIAL 10186). moṛ, \"a turn\", is the noun of moṛnā, \"to twist, bend\"."
            }
